      "title": "Random Team Generator for Classroom – Balanced Groups Made Easy",
      "meta": "Use a random team generator to create balanced groups in your classroom. Tips for avoiding repeat pairings, handling absent students, and keeping it fair.",
      "h1": "Random Team Generator for Classroom: A Teacher's Guide",
      "intro": "Creating random teams in the classroom can save time and reduce bias. A random team generator helps you form groups quickly, but there are a few things to keep in mind for fairness.",
