            "Have your student roster ready. If you want balanced teams (e.g., mix of skill levels), you may need to pre-sort or use a tool that supports constraints.",
            "Our basic random generator treats all students equally. For more control, consider grouping by criteria manually before randomizing."
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "Avoiding Repeat Pairings and Last-Pick Embarrassment",
          "paragraphs": [
            "If you generate teams multiple times, students may end up with the same partners. To avoid this, keep a log of past groupings and re-randomize from scratch.",
