          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "Handling Absent Students and Uneven Group Sizes",
          "paragraphs": [
            "If a student is absent, remove them from the list before generating. For uneven numbers, the tool will create one smaller group – that's normal.",
            "You can also add a 'placeholder' student to balance groups, then remove them after generation."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "faq": [
        {
          "q": "Can I create balanced teams by skill level?",
          "a": "Our basic tool randomizes without constraints. For balanced teams, you may need to pre-sort students into skill tiers and then randomize within each tier."
        },
