      "meta": "Understand your chimp test score. Learn what the test measures, memory strategies, and why it's not an IQ test. Device and practice effects explained.",
      "h1": "Chimp Test Scores: A Practical Guide",
      "intro": "The chimp test (also known as the 'Are You Smarter Than a Chimp?' test) measures your short-term memory for number sequences. It's a fun challenge, but it doesn't measure overall intelligence.",
      "quick_answer": "The test shows numbers briefly, then you must click them in order. Scores vary, but averages are around 7-9 digits. Device and practice affect results.",
